        <div class="stage-body">
          <span class="step">Stage one</span>
          <h3>Creche &amp; Nursery</h3>
          <p class="ages">6 months &ndash; 5 years</p>
          <p>Warm, closely supervised care and early-years learning through play, phonics and songs. Small groups,
            familiar faces, and daily updates for parents.</p>
          <a class="more" href="#academics" data-anchor="creche">More on early years</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stage">
        <div class="stage-photo" style="background-image:url(assets/img/gallery/class-group-welcome.webp)" role="img" aria-label="A class group on the first day of term"></div>
