          <span class="step">Stage two</span>
          <h3>Basic School</h3>
          <p class="ages">Primary 1 &ndash; JSS 3</p>
          <p>The Nigerian national curriculum with added strength in literacy, numeracy and ICT. Pupils sit
            Common Entrance and the BECE with real preparation behind them.</p>
          <a class="more" href="#academics" data-anchor="basic">More on basic school</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stage">
        <div class="stage-photo" style="background-image:url(assets/img/gallery/graduate-class-of-2026.webp); background-position:center 22%" role="img" aria-label="A graduating student of the Class of 2026"></div>
        <div class="stage-body">
          <span class="step">Stage three</span>
          <h3>College</h3>
          <p class="ages">SSS 1 &ndash; SSS 3</p>
          <p>Science, arts and commercial streams, with focused WAEC, NECO and JAMB preparation and one-to-one
            guidance on course and university choices.</p>
          <a class="more" href="#academics" data-anchor="college">More on college</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

