        <img src="assets/img/gallery/valedictory-2026-flyer.webp"
             alt="Notice for the 2026 Valedictory Service and Graduation Ceremony"
             width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </div>
      <div class="lead-body">
        <p class="meta">13 August 2026 &middot; Ceremony</p>
        <h2>Building a Lasting Legacy: the 2026 Valedictory Service</h2>
        <p>The school marked the close of the session with its Valedictory Service and End of Session
          Graduation Ceremony in the CTIS Main Hall, under the theme <em>Building a Lasting Legacy</em>.</p>
        <p>Graduands from Nursery 2, Basic 5, JSS 3 and SSS 3 were presented, celebrating not only
          examination results but the character built over the years that led to them. Parents, staff and
          guests joined the ceremony, which closed with the school anthem.</p>
        <p><a href="#gallery">See photographs from the day</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
