      <h2>More from the school</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3 reveal reveal-stagger">
      <article class="card card--media">
        <img src="assets/img/gallery/character-parade-2026.webp"
             alt="Basic Two pupils in costume for Character Parade Roleplay Day" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="meta">15 May 2026 &middot; Basic Two</p>
          <h3>Character Parade and Roleplay Day</h3>
          <p>Doctors, pilots, lawyers, chefs and engineers filled the steps as Basic Two dressed as what they
            hope to become.</p>
